# Image analysis, addressed by name. Nothing here runs on the client.
#
# op is one of ComputeOps::detect:
#
#   nodes_8dir          pos + neg -> per-direction node lists
#   histogram_8dir      curves + nodes for the plot panel
#   fisheye_edge        image -> centre + radius
#   roi                 image + seed -> refined point
#   ring_center         image + ring count -> centre
#   pattern_ring_radii  pattern PNG -> ring radii
#
# The number of images each op wants is fixed and documented by the op; the node
# rejects a wrong count before decoding anything, because decoding a 3040x3040
# frame to discover the request was malformed is 40 ms wasted per mistake.
string op

# In the order the op documents -- positive then negative for the two-image ops.
sensor_msgs/CompressedImage[] images

# Op parameters as JSON. Every op takes noise_cleaning here: it is a process-wide
# flag inside MoilCali, so a node serving several clients must set it per request
# rather than inheriting whatever the last caller left behind.
string params_json
---
bool success

# The op's answer as JSON. Empty when success is false.
string result_json

string message
